1279++8206              ; Build and send one maximum-size ABI 1.0 diagnostics request.
1280++8206              ; The complete 16 KiB host buffer occupies ATM RAM page 0 at C000-FFFF.
1281++8206              ; Page 0 is restored by p126_atm_video_init and is otherwise the TR-DOS
1282++8206              ; staging window. The reverse-DMA test reuses this same buffer after TX.
1283++8206              p126_neogs_dma_smoke_test:
